{"id":"n71340-6-7","stage":1,"title":"아버님 · 父亲","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71340-6-7-1","ko":"네가 벌써 결혼을 한다니 이제 다 컸구나.","zh":"你都要结婚了，看来已经长大成人了呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"결혼을","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼：结婚；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31665","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼을","audio":"/audio/577c7c1afdd9c60b7133.mp3"}},{"text":"한다니","meaning":"做、进行（결혼을 하다：结婚）","explanation":"하다：做、进行（결혼을 하다：结婚）；ㄴ다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한다니","audio":"/audio/cfadaf398d0628043264.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceRea